  "dom_id": "step-3935",
  "name": "Introduction",
  "problem": "Suppose we wish to plot the graph of ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194784/assets/d0a7418e3803197d07b85f03b206b83bed1c4d451397ae953b05634db9a9f829.svg) First, we create a table of values: \n\n| ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194784/assets/fcc5df999e3b49fae1685ee0ab5bd03709804e1dd49f2ee722c4269eb0f5506d.svg) | ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194784/assets/78d4465d85b55cee3832a9b598a2564b6a3fa9a072de8a1fb4b40ca884079670.svg) | ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194784/assets/63df422d619ca962ca5a69bc7d25dd8831269b92fa5d641dcb960819d3868a9a.svg) | ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194784/assets/66ef4b5796888b4025ee2d8b3d516ec80741b341db9389696b6e77a4af5208d8.svg) | ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194784/assets/156b31ede73de5301befe67f02745a0202f1806a62f9fdecc6fc9ee3f21117ba.svg) | ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194784/assets/95836ae470c61ab15bfb67d6f0c92d2ad8d03d400b04473e81e58de3ee44bf32.svg) | ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194784/assets/f5f3224583db57b9cfe323c8489ef5e5271000002b5ea253eb98fd067a858b2d.svg) | ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194784/assets/6cb44f25e489afb06ec62d2e95c4d235ece77eb36e2327b856264d2fb8b22c21.svg) |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194784/assets/e51853c53dfd3d72f8fd380044f7ce864974b3d8c1ca0e690b7caba34fe3456c.svg) | ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194784/assets/c700188055bde6c02303571bfb6b737fddda4a14c08edf1cdeeaf684530eea88.svg) | ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194784/assets/402ff5d0c0c3aaa47f18c89f6d96c95d47840eac13822d596a51bdb0c5f9a4ab.svg) | ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194784/assets/f5f3224583db57b9cfe323c8489ef5e5271000002b5ea253eb98fd067a858b2d.svg) | ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194784/assets/95836ae470c61ab15bfb67d6f0c92d2ad8d03d400b04473e81e58de3ee44bf32.svg) | ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194784/assets/0b47cf9f83219ef6bab2ac82c70ded537ce9db2ab3945b85d5ca678f16b30a75.svg) | ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194784/assets/fce859f2a3c5348530c75d1a07cf8bb4ff0a228bdf8d1e493294b4489b84fdee.svg) | ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194784/assets/8ab6a43799989375f441258e25082fb84a876ad9273de9dba1bc200dca195381.svg) |\n\nNow, we can plot the graph:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194784/assets/b045833e2e37e2ed4c35e9c8abe8c379dfd7de7eded17d4dc943205677d7fce5.png)\n\nNote the following key points:\n\n1\\. The graph has a ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194784/assets/1d9b846cface9f9348e4081a0dd87dd254bf26663c12aa0d1a15aa24d2393261.svg)-intercept at ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194784/assets/fd83db97b0675d3527a9f2a7a68d38a98f2d05ab5b1771d961c0d687e44c191b.svg)\n\n2\\. The graph is decreasing.\n\n3\\. For ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194784/assets/e45cbcbc2e3f466cab4e379776bce2640286bc2a918ff0177c0433b97f7cd4b7.svg), the graph grows very rapidly as ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194784/assets/fcc5df999e3b49fae1685ee0ab5bd03709804e1dd49f2ee722c4269eb0f5506d.svg) decreases. Symbolically, we can write ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194784/assets/f54328d6cf80c554acae5f7a9693b0eb4ea745ec0a4b0f5013b03a3e41ae27db.svg) as ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194784/assets/7248bd0778a7746f6b1018c7bc926d8e678ba829b741beed092d802bd7ba1233.svg)\n\n4\\. For ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194784/assets/ee98d74fc058e95e72d13a5e575e70e4d5adedd26413e3f01ab1e3f788be87e8.svg), the graph gets very close to zero as ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194784/assets/fcc5df999e3b49fae1685ee0ab5bd03709804e1dd49f2ee722c4269eb0f5506d.svg) increases. However, it never actually reaches zero, so the graph has a horizontal asymptote ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194784/assets/6c63827e94b6c11a9803605bd54156d90d3fcc6ff4639dd179a5fb024bcffaa1.svg) Symbolically, we can write ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194784/assets/43a6d025efce6b330ba7907d1daa54ad58cf04feee07adedad66d4c806b5f88d.svg) as ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194784/assets/f9b318487299434d45096742eaad8ea148abb88c27b718c1bc0983f927dc9911.svg)\n\n5\\. The domain is ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194784/assets/043681a7084203dcb8609f78989cadb8f0bcd701978361940d93ef850da95a14.svg), and the range is ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194784/assets/95d0bc38cd8737723521d2a1846cb71a0dba33d3df26bd73c18acbb650fc8b95.svg)\n\nThese key points apply to *any* exponential curve ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194784/assets/90517bb7bc12cfec9d00d88592bbda7572f4a0c5cbcf4f66049311d42f20f6ca.svg) with ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194784/assets/e276af13a21df7f4755de7b18da1a10ca590bbdf3387515efa0896f6cddb79cf.svg) These graphs always have the same general shape:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194784/assets/0f8e7cc0db94f5f51bc83404351a7708171fdce50e2946b51263885e4230ecef.png)",
